    "# Notebook 02: Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)\n",
    "**ChurnGuard AI Project**\n",
    "\n",
    "Analysis of customer demographic patterns, tenure distributions, service add-on correlations, and contract type impact on churn rate."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
